TRAINING DATA

akshar v0, akshar v1 and akshar-lite v0 were trained on the following datasets. data/LICENSES.md records each
source's licence, revision and why it was admitted (decisions D5, D21, D26).

IndicVoices (Hindi), AI4Bharat
  CC-BY-4.0, https://huggingface.co/datasets/ai4bharat/IndicVoices

Kathbath (Hindi), AI4Bharat
  CC-BY-4.0, https://huggingface.co/datasets/ai4bharat/Kathbath

Rural Women ASR v2 (Hindi), AI4Bharat
  CC-BY-4.0, https://huggingface.co/datasets/ai4bharat/Rural_Women_ASR_v2

NPTEL (English and Hindi lectures), AI4Bharat, from NPTEL course lectures
  CC-BY-4.0, https://huggingface.co/datasets/ai4bharat/NPTEL

FLEURS (Hindi, train split), Google
  CC-BY-4.0, https://huggingface.co/datasets/google/fleurs

MUCS 2021 Hindi-English code-switching data (train split), from the MUCS 2021 challenge
  CC-BY-SA-4.0, https://www.openslr.org/104/ (copy used: https://huggingface.co/datasets/dianavdavidson/MUCS-Hinglish)

LibriSpeech (train-clean-100), Vassil Panayotov, Guoguo Chen, Daniel Povey and Sanjeev Khudanpur
  CC-BY-4.0, https://www.openslr.org/12/

Silence and noise clips generated by akshar's own code (akshar/data/nonspeech.py).

Staged for later versions, not yet in a released model:

Shrutilipi (Hindi), AI4Bharat, from All India Radio news bulletins
  CC-BY-4.0, https://huggingface.co/datasets/ai4bharat/Shrutilipi

Vaani, transcribed part (Hindi), ARTPARK and the Indian Institute of Science
  CC-BY-4.0, https://huggingface.co/datasets/ARTPARK-IISc/Vaani-transcription-part

This repository does not distribute model weights or datasets.
